<title>SPAIN: Spain's Aznar - Amsterdam summit made good progress.</title>
<headline>Spain's Aznar - Amsterdam summit made good progress.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar said on Wednesday after his from Amsterdam, that the European Union summit which took place there was on balance positive.</p>
<p>&quot;.. overall we made more than substantial progress in the summit, so we can be reasonably satisfied,&quot; Aznar told state radio in a interview.</p>
</text>
